"tor[j].volt;\n        \t\t\tswap.pos       = Vxyvector[j].pos;\n\n        \t"
"\t\tVxyvector[j].volt   = Vxyvector[j+1].volt;\n        \t\t\tVxyvector[j].po"
"s   = Vxyvector[j+1].pos;\n        \t\t\tVxyvector[j+1].volt = swap.volt;\n  "
