"r[nc-i-1].pos]=tabla[level][i];\n \t}\n \telse\n \t{\n \t\tcarga=0;\n \t\tfor"
"(i=0;i<nc;i++)\n \t \t\tSWtemp[Vxyvector[i].pos]=tabla[level][i];\n \t}\n  }"
"\n  else{\n  \tif(Vref<0)\n  \t{\n  \t\tcarga=1;\n  \t\tfor(i=0;i<nc;i++)\n "
"\t \t\tSWtemp[Vxyvector[nc-i-1].pos]=tabla[level][i];\n \t}\n\telse\n\t\t{\n"
"\t\tcarga=0;\n\t\tfor(i=0;i<nc;i++)\n \t \t\tSWtemp[Vxyvector[i].pos]=tabla[l"
